    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732490/extras/166089869ea62e19e2b0c201b6c1a010.avif?t=1753696953\" width=460 height=214 /></span><br><strong>Background introduction:</strong><br>As an ordinary man, you encounter a mysterious incident and travel to a game world full of various female characters. When you find that you must get along with these female characters and understand their stories, in order to solve the mysteries of this world and find Way back to the real world.<br>Of course, in the interaction with each female character, you gradually develop feelings...<br>It's just that the strange nurse sister, the mysterious boss sister, the cute student sister, and the weird alien girl, etc., they all seem to need to rely on men to survive...?<br>Sure enough, this world is not as simple as you imagined...!<br><br><strong>Character introduction:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732490/extras/5f1952d73f74de3f9f2ec1c890ffcf1f.avif?t=1753696953\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>Jiue\u2014\u2014<i>Weird alien girl</i><br>The girl with the horns is firmly tied up at a high place. You have just woken up and can't control your body yet, so you can only stick your neck and look around...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732490/extras/6b7232470872d38c6425d754700dde13.avif?t=1753696953\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>Youmei\u2014\u2014<i>The mysterious boss sister</i><br>She stood in the lounge with an angry look on her face and glanced at the door uneasily. You followed her, wondering what would happen?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732490/extras/a13ebf5bc9b7125be52464c9d940bef7.avif?t=1753696953\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>Jiuhui\u2014\u2014<i>Cute student sister</i><br>Jiuhui\u2019s classmate always behaves like he doesn\u2019t pay attention to anyone at school! As a tablemate, you know that she plays games every night. But when she continues to lie on the table listlessly, you can't help but wonder what game it is?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732490/extras/c38717a6ecad709f76ae84aa4bf4fc07.avif?t=1753696953\" width=300 height=300 /></span><br>Hesha - <i>the lively and aloof school beauty</i><br>The most dazzling and arrogant girl in the whole grade invites you to play with her at her house on Christmas night after graduation...<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>What you will experience in this game:</strong><br></li><li>Unique and innovative 12 plot stories<br></li><li> Casual, fun and classic match-3 mini-game<br></li><li> Cute, beautiful and unique female characters<br></li><li>Skip with one click</li></ul>",
